WEBVTT

00:19.840 --> 00:21.040
Your son

00:21.120 --> 00:22.520
Accepts the edict

00:34.500 --> 00:50.500
Not long after, Sikong Zheng ascended the throne, changing the era name to Changle. He subsequently complied with the late Emperor's testamentary edict, sending the dependents of the Prince of Jin's household to the north.

00:55.560 --> 00:56.960
Need hot water

00:57.720 --> 00:58.240
A'da

00:58.320 --> 00:59.400
Go bring a basin of hot water for Yue'er

00:59.480 --> 01:00.320
Got it

01:00.400 --> 01:02.400
And hurry with Nian'er over there

01:06.280 --> 01:07.640
Push

01:07.720 --> 01:09.120
Push harder

01:09.760 --> 01:11.160
Almost, almost

01:11.760 --> 01:13.160
Push hard

01:13.840 --> 01:15.240
Keep pushing

01:16.280 --> 01:17.680
Push, Lady Zu

01:19.960 --> 01:20.600
Hot water

01:20.680 --> 01:22.080
A'jiao

01:24.280 --> 01:24.960
And Nian'er over there

01:25.040 --> 01:26.440
Good, good, good

01:29.440 --> 01:32.120
You'd think giving birth would happen at the same time

01:32.200 --> 01:34.200
You two, stop pacing around here

01:35.080 --> 01:35.960
Wife

01:36.040 --> 01:37.240
I'm really nervous

01:37.320 --> 01:38.800
When I gave birth to Sheng'er

01:38.960 --> 01:40.480
You were leading troops in battle

01:40.560 --> 01:42.560
Why weren't you this nervous then?

01:43.200 --> 01:45.200
Take your son and go aside

01:47.040 --> 01:48.040
Born, born

01:48.120 --> 01:49.787
Lady Zu has given birth

01:54.160 --> 01:55.120
Congratulations, Your Highness

01:55.200 --> 01:56.600
It's a son

02:08.240 --> 02:09.160
Yue'er

02:09.240 --> 02:10.160
Our family will have

02:10.240 --> 02:11.640
A great general

02:12.800 --> 02:14.200
Giving birth

02:14.280 --> 02:15.840
Is much more tiring than killing people

02:15.920 --> 02:17.120
Born, born

02:17.240 --> 02:18.520
Lady Liu has also given birth

02:18.600 --> 02:20.000
It's a daughter

02:33.280 --> 02:36.120
Criminal Chen Dao embezzled and perverted justice

02:36.240 --> 02:37.680
Colluded with foreign enemies

02:37.800 --> 02:39.760
Allowed his servants to harm the people

02:39.840 --> 02:41.360
Causing public resentment

02:41.680 --> 02:43.347
Deserves execution for his crimes

02:46.280 --> 02:47.680
Behead him

03:06.120 --> 03:07.760
I've endured for so many years

03:07.840 --> 03:09.840
Finally caught you

03:16.760 --> 03:17.960
Now

03:18.120 --> 03:19.880
Who is your king?

03:20.120 --> 03:21.040
Shilang

03:21.120 --> 03:22.080
Shilang

03:22.160 --> 03:23.040
Shilang

03:23.120 --> 03:23.800
Shilang

03:23.880 --> 03:25.280
Wolf cubs

03:25.480 --> 03:27.160
Follow me south

03:30.560 --> 03:33.440
The wheel of history still turns

03:33.680 --> 03:35.040
The future story

03:35.120 --> 03:37.920
Will continue to be written by you
